            "kind": "advice",
            "id": "ADV-BASE-003",
            "severity": "info",
            "text": "自评 {{subject.self_appearance}} 分，比照片维度映射区间（{{appearance.photoTrack.mappedInterval.low}}–{{appearance.photoTrack.mappedInterval.high}}）高 {{appearance.divergence}} 分。常见来源：熟悉度滤镜、妆造加成、照片挑选偏向；也可能是拍摄条件没有拍出真实水平。"
          }
